mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mn>22</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mo>+</mo></mtd><mtd><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mn>7</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo stretchy=\"false\">↙</mo></mtd><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo stretchy=\"false\">↙</mo></mtd><mtd></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mn>22</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mn>7</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mo>+</mo></mtd><mtd><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mn>1</mn></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Solving for the rightmost terms in the equations above, we get</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"378\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 6.278em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: red;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: left; padding-left: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle space=\"4\" style=\"color: red;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22C5\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-